     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">程式碼:<div>library(deal)<br></div><div><div>library(bnlearn)</div></div><div>life&lt;-read.csv(&#39;<a href=\"http://file.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://file.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237696316000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00WF61_GJh8eW5qzNe2d53\">file.name</a>&#39;)<br></div><div><br></div><div>#將連續、離散值指派為nemeric、factor<br></div><div><br></div><div>life$A&lt;-as.factor(life$A)<br></div><div>life$B&lt;-as.factor(life$B)<br></div><div>life$C&lt;-as.factor(life$C)<br></div><div>life$D&lt;-as.factor(life$D)</div><div>life$E&lt;-as.factor(life$E)<br></div><div>life$F&lt;-as.factor(life$F)<br></div><div>life$G&lt;-as.factor(life$G)<br></div><div>life$H&lt;-as.factor(life$H)<br></div><div><br></div><div>life$I&lt;-as.numeric(life$I)<br></div><div>life$J&lt;-as.numeric(life$J)<br></div><div><br></div><div>#建立網路  #連續值無法連結到離散值<br></div><div>lifedraw&lt;-network(life,specifygraph=TRUE)<br></div><div><br></div><div>network ↓</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_sUF1P-IO2w/WRKQMUH6SeI/AAAAAAAAEQk/QMdYjvROBNwAMjzW8SD1Qluba7mWu8k2gCLcB/s1600/%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%25871.jpg\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_sUF1P-IO2w/WRKQMUH6SeI/AAAAAAAAEQk/QMdYjvROBNwAMjzW8SD1Qluba7mWu8k2gCLcB/s1600/%2525E5%25259C%252596%2525E7%252589%2525871.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237696316000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wZqhGrZAcbS2ycNoWhMct\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_sUF1P-IO2w/WRKQMUH6SeI/AAAAAAAAEQk/QMdYjvROBNwAMjzW8SD1Qluba7mWu8k2gCLcB/s320/%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%25871.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"286\"></a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>#抽樣<br></div><div>npm=ceiling(0.2*nrow(life))<br></div><div><br></div><div><div>ti=sample(1:nrow(life),npm)</div><div>life.test=life[ti,]</div><div>life.train=life[-ti,]</div></div><div><br></div><div>#將deal的模型匯到bnlearn，網路從network轉換成bn<br></div><div>dnet=bnlearn::<a href=\"http://as.bn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.bn&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237696316000&amp;usg=AOvVaw11kxI8pb8y3p3KzAk161sh\">as.bn</a>(deal::modelstring(lifedraw))<br></div><div><br></div><div><div>#model fitting</div><div>fitted1 = bn.fit(dnet, life.train)</div></div><div><br></div><div>------------------------------------------------------------------------------</div><div><br></div><div>問題1,</div><div><br></div><div>從deal模型轉到BN模型時，可以增加什麼指令或是程式碼，讓BN模型變成高斯BN，可以跑連續值？</div><div>因為從 fitted(fitted1) 可以得到 I 這個 numeric 只有一個數字再跑</div><div>所以希望可以改善這個問題。</div><div><br></div><div>問題2,</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>從程式碼得到的其中一個<font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:black\">Conditional\r\nprobability </span><span style=\"color:black\">table:</span></font></div><div><br></div><div>        0      1</div><div>A     0.96  0.04</div><div><br></div><div><div>        0      1</div><div>B     0.36  0.64</div></div><div><br></div><div>-------------------------------------------------</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;font-size:small\">       </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;font-size:small\">  B=1 C=0 D=0 E=0 F=0</span></div><div><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">G                A</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">          0            1</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">1      0.88        0.71</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">2     0.066      0.15</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">3     0.054      0.14</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">上述的數字，可以從Excel表裡面，篩選B=1時，A=0  做 G  1 2 3 的 比例  及  A=1  做G 1 2 3 的比例</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">不像是貝氏網裡面的條件機率</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">又或著是說，透過程式碼得到的</font>dnet，  這個BN模型只是單純跑各個節點到彼此之間的比例值而已</div><div>如果是這樣，程式碼該如何修改才能得到我要的條件機率？</div><div><br></div><div>還是說，我假設A B 為獨立事件， 當A = 1 B=1  選擇做1的機率為</div><div>0.04*0.64  * 0.71 /   0.04*0.64*(0.71+0.15+0.14)  = 0.71</div><div>所以矩陣內的機率才是   [1,2] = 0.71 ?  </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>以上，謝謝</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
